# Files Cloudflare must not upload.
#
# The deploy serves the repo ROOT, so anything here is publicly fetchable
# unless excluded. Most important: .git — serving it would expose the
# entire history, every deleted file and every old secret.
.git/
.github/
node_modules/
.wrangler/
wrangler.jsonc
wrangler.toml

# Superseded presentation templates. Nothing links to them and two were
# past the 25 MiB per-asset limit.
assets/downloads/Finals/Presentation/Old/

# Build and handover tooling — source, not site.
*.py
*.md
feedback.txt
Newmed_brandguidelines_inputs.docx
docx_images/
index_backup.html
styles_backup.css
styles_v2.css
v2.html
